ging wide-ranging reforms to FIFA, expanding global participation in ...\", \"original_document_number\": 2}], \"R5_answers\": [\"Gianni Infantino\", \"Roger Goodell\", \"Daniel Burley Woolfall\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C2\", \"answer\": \"Daniel Burley Woolfall\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C1\", \"answer\": \"Roger Goodell\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"Gianni Infantino\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}]}"
